stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> IDLE: PowerOn + SelfCheckPassed
    IDLE --> NAVIGATING: ValidRequest + Authorised
    IDLE --> IDLE: Invalid/unauthorised request / reject + log
    NAVIGATING --> AVOIDING_OBSTACLE: ObstacleDetected
    AVOIDING_OBSTACLE --> NAVIGATING: ObstacleCleared + route revalidated
    NAVIGATING --> DELIVERING: DestinationReached + delivery guards pass
    DELIVERING --> RETURNING: HandoverConfirmed
    RETURNING --> IDLE: WarehouseReached + reset checks pass
    NAVIGATING --> RETURNING: CriticalBattery / only if approved safe-return policy permits
    NAVIGATING --> SAFE_MODE: CriticalThermal or critical fault
    AVOIDING_OBSTACLE --> SAFE_MODE: CriticalBattery or CriticalThermal
    DELIVERING --> SAFE_MODE: CriticalBattery or CriticalThermal
    RETURNING --> SAFE_MODE: CriticalThermal or critical fault
    IDLE --> SAFE_MODE: CriticalBattery or CriticalThermal
    NAVIGATING --> LINK_LOST: HeartbeatExpired
    AVOIDING_OBSTACLE --> LINK_LOST: HeartbeatExpired
    DELIVERING --> LINK_LOST: HeartbeatExpired
    RETURNING --> LINK_LOST: HeartbeatExpired
    LINK_LOST --> SAFE_MODE: Unsafe/unknown local condition
    LINK_LOST --> IDLE: LinkRestored + reconciliation + safe reset
    NAVIGATING --> CROSSING_HOLD: Crossing boundary reached
    CROSSING_HOLD --> NAVIGATING: Fresh valid clearance + barrier open + no train
    CROSSING_HOLD --> SAFE_MODE: Sensor disagreement or critical crossing fault
    SAFE_MODE --> IDLE: Fault cleared + self-check + authorised recovery
    AVOIDING_OBSTACLE --> SAFE_MODE: Obstacle timeout / unable to clear safely
    SAFE_MODE --> [*]
